Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.89,0:00:06.06,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,We were standing outside the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:10.42,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Don't go too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.11,0:00:14.63,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Or else we won't be able to get back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.11,0:00:18.77,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,This is a world that had ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.43,0:00:21.64,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,There is no one here other than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.75,0:00:26.89,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,We were looking for junk that could be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.12,0:00:32.51,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,We have to find our own tools for living.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:36.37,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I'll take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.42,0:00:38.47,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Let's take this back, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.49,0:01:41.69,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Were you scared of being alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.88,0:01:47.84,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.49,0:01:51.46,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:01.73,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.18,0:02:07.23,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,They had a gentle smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.05,0:02:33.64,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}The hill you once walked down...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.05,0:02:33.64,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf24}ki{\kf23}mi {\kf20}da{\kf22}ke {\kf33}ga {\kf32}su{\kf19}gi{\kf27}sa{\kf19}t{\kf39}ta {\kf48}sa{\kf43}ka {\kf42}no {\kf39}to{\kf24}chu{\kf29}u {\kf75}wa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.64,0:02:39.27,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}...was now covered with many spots of sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.64,0:02:39.27,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf25}a{\kf25}ta{\kf21}ta{\kf21}ka {\kf41}na {\kf22}hi{\kf22}da{\kf28}ma{\kf21}ri {\kf38}ga {\kf43}i{\kf42}ku{\kf45}tsu {\kf22}mo {\kf20}de{\kf22}ki{\kf22}te{\kf84}ta
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.27,0:02:44.49,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I'm standing here alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.27,0:02:44.49,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf27}bo{\kf21}ku {\kf40}hi{\kf45}to{\kf43}ri {\kf85}ga {\kf24}ko{\kf22}ko {\kf43}de {\kf35}ya{\kf41}sa{\kf41}shi{\kf55}i
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.49,0:02:52.16,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}remembering all the heart-warming memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.49,0:02:52.16,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf21}a{\kf21}ta{\kf44}ta{\kf35}ka{\kf55}sa {\kf80}wo {\kf19}o{\kf27}mo{\kf44}i {\kf45}ka{\kf34}e{\kf96}shi{\kf24}te{\kf190}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.16,0:02:59.83,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,0)}You were the one... You were the one...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.16,0:02:59.83,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,0)}{\kf45}ki{\kf47}mi {\kf61}da{\kf65}ke {\kf197}wo  {\kf24}ki{\kf65}mi {\kf61}da{\kf26}ke {\kf176}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.83,0:03:06.06,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...who I loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.83,0:03:06.06,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf78}su{\kf67}ki {\kf214}de {\kf65}i{\kf65}ta{\kf129}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.06,0:03:13.81,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}My eyes start to water from the wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.06,0:03:13.81,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf44}ka{\kf43}ze {\kf64}de {\kf62}me {\kf211}ga {\kf71}ni{\kf67}ji{\kf26}n{\kf185}de
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.81,0:03:20.77,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}and you become a distant figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.81,0:03:20.77,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf89}to{\kf44}o{\kf201}ku {\kf84}na{\kf59}ru {\kf219}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.77,0:03:23.07,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I will always remember...
