Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.90,0:03:25.19,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...no matter the changes.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.90,0:03:25.19,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf22}na{\kf18}ni{\kf21}mo {\kf26}ka{\kf21}mo {\kf27}ka{\kf18}wa{\kf19}t{\kf22}te{\kf19}mo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.06,0:03:27.40,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Just this one thing, this one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.06,0:03:27.40,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf19}hi{\kf19}to{\kf26}tsu {\kf20}da{\kf19}ke {\kf23}hi{\kf19}to{\kf24}tsu {\kf23}da{\kf20}ke
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.18,0:03:29.91,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}though it's a plain thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.18,0:03:29.91,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf24}a{\kf23}ri{\kf20}fu{\kf23}re{\kf19}ta {\kf18}mo{\kf21}no {\kf21}da{\kf29}ke{\kf40}do
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:33.87,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}I will show it to you, this one thing covered in glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:33.87,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf25}mi{\kf18}se{\kf25}te {\kf22}ya{\kf19}ru {\kf18}ka{\kf21}ga{\kf23}ya{\kf23}ki {\kf20}ni {\kf17}mi{\kf26}chi{\kf14}ta {\kf27}so{\kf26}no {\kf15}hi{\kf23}to{\kf28}tsu {\kf22}da{\kf16}ke
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.87,0:03:39.12,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}Forever and ever, I shall hold it dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.87,0:03:39.12,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}{\kf19}i{\kf28}tsu{\kf21}ma{\kf27}de{\kf17}mo {\kf14}i{\kf32}tsu{\kf19}ma{\kf21}de{\kf17}mo {\kf23}ma{\kf23}mo{\kf22}t{\kf16}te {\kf27}i{\kf200}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:47.92,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Are you eating at the cafeteria for lunch again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.34,0:03:50.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You just got here, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.84,0:03:51.30,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.76,0:03:55.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Start right. Otherwise, you'll mess up my rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.22,0:04:01.73,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Fine. Then I'll start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.10,0:04:05.02,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hello, Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:07.19,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Are you eating at the cafeteria for lunch again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.27,0:04:09.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You sound so refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.82,0:04:10.48,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.07,0:04:13.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's too refreshing coming from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.53,0:04:15.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You weirded me out with your change in character.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.91,0:04:17.32,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Then what am I supposed to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.32,0:04:20.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,At the end of the sentence, always add the phrase, "and a toilet seat cover".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:24.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That will counter the freshness and make you sound more like yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.79,0:04:27.71,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.04,0:04:31.71,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410.000015)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Episode 2
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.04,0:04:31.71,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}In Search of False Love
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.42,0:04:30.42,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'll do it one of these days when I feel like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:37.22,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What? Mei's staying over at Nagisa-chan's again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.22,0:04:39.72,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,We're perfectly happy having her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.72,0:04:42.27,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Since we all love Mei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.18,0:04:47.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She called ahead and let her parents and school know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.73,0:04:49.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Apparently she's worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.94,0:04:55.82,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Onii-chan's a senior, and it's the second semester, yet he still doesn't know what he'll be doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.41,0:04:59.03,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I'm so worried I can't go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.07,0:05:03.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She said she wants to have a good talk with you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.25,0:05:08.38,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sunohara-san. Do you have a goal or something you want to do? {ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:11.75,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I've never thought about it. {ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:16.76,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I can't go to college, so I'll find a job and work. {ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.18,0:05:25.39,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Well, if I had a level-headed girlfriend, too,\NI bet my sister would rest easier. {ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.98,0:05:27.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's it! {ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.69,0:05:34.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Basically, we'll show her that you have\Na girlfriend who you've sworn your life to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.32,0:05:36.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sure Mei-chan will stop worrying that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.74,0:05:39.32,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I don't think you should tell her a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.74,0:05:41.20,Default-alt,Sun,0,0,0,,Would something like that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:45.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So you know, you're actually not that ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.25,0:05:48.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You've got a baby face, so you're the type that tickles the maternal instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.87,0:05:51.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This school's number one baby face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.21,0:05:52.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Baby Sunohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.30,0:05:54.76,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Y-You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.21,0:06:00.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You might end up dating the fake girlfriend for real with this as a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.97,0:06:02.72,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okazaki magic, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.72,0:06:04.97,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.22,0:06:10.19,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun. Aren't you just having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.19,0:06:12.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.06,0:06:16.78,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Are there any obedient girls who'll probably listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.78,0:06:18.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're really underhanded, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.74,0:06:20.61,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I found a perfect candidate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.99,0:06:23.08,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.08,0:06:23.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.99,0:06:25.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're going to ask her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.42,0:06:33.75,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You don't have to be that surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.75,0:06:35.84,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Pretend. It's just pretend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.84,0:06:39.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If you can't, you can say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.09,0:06:43.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Since you know well what kind of a guy he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.93,0:06:45.60,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I can't. It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:47.47,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,It's too much for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.23,0:06:50.77,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Just thinking about it is so embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.77,0:06:52.90,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I can't possibly...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:06:56.40,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please don't cry, Ryou-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.86,0:07:02.78,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,When you see something like this,\Ndoesn't it make you want to keep going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.53,0:07:06.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey. If you say something like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.09,0:07:17.50,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Ryou?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:18.42,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Was he picking on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:20.34,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.34,0:07:22.05,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,It wasn't anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.05,0:07:25.68,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You two. What did you do to my cute sister?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.97,0:07:28.56,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You misunderstand, Kyou-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.06,0:07:32.69,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,We're actually looking for\Na fake girlfriend for Sunohara-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.69,0:07:34.77,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,How about we try asking Kyou?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.52,0:07:37.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I doubt she'd say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.94,0:07:40.49,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yeah, given her character...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.49,0:07:45.28,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Vicious and hot-headed, says\Nunreasonable things and uses me like a slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:47.78,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I can hear everything you're saying, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:50.75,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You care to repeat those words?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.75,0:07:56.13,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,If you do, I'll stick my hand down your throat and rip out your vocal cords as a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.13,0:07:57.46,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.30,0:07:59.96,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I apologized, didn't I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.21,0:08:04.18,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Your apologizing face pissed me off for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.84,0:08:07.26,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Let's go, Ryou.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.26,0:08:09.18,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Their idiocy will infect us if we stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.18,0:08:10.27,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.39,0:08:16.73,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Why do guys lack delicacy so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.73,0:08:18.23,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:24.45,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Are you really all right, Sunohara-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.45,0:08:30.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't worry. He shines brightest when he's being picked on by girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.16,0:08:32.16,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Don't say things that'll cause misunderstandings!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:38.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But with both Fujibayashi and Kyou down, who else might say yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.17,0:08:45.30,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,How about asking Tomoyo-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.80,0:08:46.43,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.43,0:08:49.30,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,She's beautiful and takes good care of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.30,0:08:51.26,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I think she's a nice person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.26,0:08:53.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We'd better not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.39,0:08:54.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He's wimping out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.77,0:08:57.85,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Don't be an idiot! Who's w-wimping out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.85,0:08:59.27,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You had an extra "w" there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.77,0:09:02.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Take a deep breath and calm down first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.24,0:09:07.99,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okay. I'm ready to give birth to a good kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.99,0:09:10.37,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sunohara-san, you're panicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.74,0:09:14.75,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,If you think about it, she and I are fated rivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.21,0:09:17.87,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,We would fight every time we bumped into each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.67,0:09:24.84,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,What's wrong? You seem troubled; that's unlike you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.72,0:09:27.51,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It's got nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.59,0:09:30.14,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.72,0:09:32.47,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.72,0:09:38.94,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I don't want to see you lose to anyone other then me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:48.91,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Deep down, there's mutual respect between those who recognize each other's strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.91,0:09:50.16,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's so touching!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.91,0:09:52.70,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Therefore I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.70,0:09:58.75,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Tea stains are actually tannin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.75,0:10:02.04,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Baking soda is often used to wash them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.04,0:10:02.96,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,If you don't have any-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.80,0:10:08.76,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,If you don't have any, vinegar should be fine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.76,0:10:10.72,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Don't ignore me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.72,0:10:13.39,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Sakagami-san, you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.39,0:10:16.31,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Stay away. It's dangerous to make eye contact with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.14,0:10:19.06,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Don't talk of me like I'm an animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.06,0:10:22.31,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoyo-san. Please listen to what he has to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.31,0:10:24.19,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Oh, Furukawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.19,0:10:26.36,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Yesterday's baseball game was fun, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.19,0:10:27.99,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.99,0:10:30.20,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You looked really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.66,0:10:34.62,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,It's actually my first time calling you Furukawa-san, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.24,0:10:36.33,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Was that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.33,0:10:38.12,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.12,0:10:39.08,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:41.71,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Could you two not carry on a conversation without me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.71,0:10:44.13,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,What, you were still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.13,0:10:47.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He has a favor to ask. Could you hear him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.51,0:10:54.22,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,You guys come asking for favors a lot, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.81,0:10:58.35,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm really troubled right now, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.35,0:11:01.35,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,You look carefree to me, as you always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.44,0:11:03.98,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It's got nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.98,0:11:05.65,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Exactly. See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.65,0:11:10.32,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,No! You're supposed to say, "I don't want to see you lose to anyone other then me."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:13.03,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I've never considered saying that in my life, not even the slightest bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.03,0:11:15.37,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Just say it! Or else we can't advance the story!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.99,0:11:22.00,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I don't want to see you lose to anyone other than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:24.75,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,"Lose"? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:25.79,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,How about we-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.05,0:11:30.05,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,If he wanted to fight, he should have said so immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.55,0:11:32.38,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,See you, Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:33.84,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Furukawa-san, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.30,0:11:36.97,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,That was so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.97,0:11:38.68,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,As expected of Sakagami-san.
