Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:43.81,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.81,0:11:44.81,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.81,0:11:46.82,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You're so kind, Kotomi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:50.15,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I want to be of help to my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.15,0:11:52.70,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Tell me what I should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.70,0:11:58.62,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,If you're dating, I think you would hang out and do all sorts of fun things together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.62,0:11:59.58,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.91,0:12:01.08,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.04,0:12:03.21,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.71,0:12:08.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Look at what you made her do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.55,0:12:11.38,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Didn't the violin get fixed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.38,0:12:14.51,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Yes. It makes better sound than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.51,0:12:17.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's actually gotten worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.81,0:12:20.93,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Was it really all right, Sunohara-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.93,0:12:23.81,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,She agreed to act for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.23,0:12:27.69,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I don't have the willpower to make it through that sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.69,0:12:29.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.15,0:12:31.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We still have one hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.86,0:12:33.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Miyazawa, are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.53,0:12:37.87,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san, Furukawa-san, Sunohara-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.87,0:12:38.99,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.99,0:12:42.41,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes, it has been a while, Miyazawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.41,0:12:44.00,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yukine-chan, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.00,0:12:47.63,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yeah, you look like you'll do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.84,0:12:51.38,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,What is this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.38,0:12:54.38,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,To act as a girlfriend, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.38,0:12:56.43,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,It sounds difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.43,0:12:58.39,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.39,0:13:00.89,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'll lead you along well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.89,0:13:02.68,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,So please. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.10,0:13:04.98,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I've been listening for a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.19,0:13:12.11,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are to ask such a thing of our Yuki-nee?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.28,0:13:15.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"Our Yuki-nee?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.20,0:13:16.99,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Miyazawa-san, who is this person?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.99,0:13:19.16,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,He's my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.16,0:13:22.62,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,There is a small issue, so he is hiding here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.62,0:13:24.16,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Let me tell you clearly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.16,0:13:28.08,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,If you cause any trouble for Yuki-nee, we won't let you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.08,0:13:29.08,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Do you hear?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.30,0:13:36.34,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Crap, I wasn't supposed to come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.43,0:13:41.18,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Yuki-nee, if anything happens, call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.18,0:13:42.85,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I'll dash over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.52,0:13:45.73,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,You shouldn't go out yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.73,0:13:47.02,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,You need to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.02,0:13:49.15,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I need to excuse myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.07,0:13:55.32,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.61,0:13:58.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Looks like she has some things to deal with, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.03,0:14:04.70,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm going to leave you two here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.70,0:14:07.87,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I have to help make dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.87,0:14:11.25,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Good luck, Sunohara-san. {ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:17.63,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,"Good luck" she says, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.34,0:14:21.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It wasn't right to ask for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.64,0:14:23.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let's put out a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.51,0:14:25.97,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.97,0:14:30.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter, since you're going to charm her, anyway, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.19,0:14:33.15,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.15,0:14:35.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,First, you have to flatter the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.44,0:14:40.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And, girls these days like to keep secrets,\Nso let her know that secrets are safe with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.20,0:14:45.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Lastly, using group psychology to your advantage, appeal saying that everyone does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.66,0:14:47.79,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.79,0:14:48.83,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm off then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.83,0:14:51.46,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hey there cutie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.46,0:14:52.21,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.08,0:14:54.00,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Do you have some time right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:56.50,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It'd be great if you would even just listen to what I need to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:59.84,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I actually have a good part-time job for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.84,0:15:02.18,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I'm in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.68,0:15:04.76,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I won't say your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:07.68,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,And I'll keep it a secret to your parents, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:11.10,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Everyone's doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.35,0:15:15.19,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,That makes me sound like I'm scouting her for something sketchy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.77,0:15:16.73,Default,San,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.32,0:15:19.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sanae-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.07,0:15:22.86,Default,San,0,0,0,,Are you having some trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.07,0:15:25.07,Default,San,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.07,0:15:28.95,Default,San,0,0,0,,If that's the case, would you allow me to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.79,0:15:33.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you serious, Sanae-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.00,0:15:36.46,Default,San,0,0,0,,It's for none other than Mei-chan's brother's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:38.96,Default,San,0,0,0,,If I can be of help, then I'll gladly do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:41.55,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,W-W-Wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.26,0:15:45.72,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okazaki. She's Nagisa-chan's older sister, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.72,0:15:47.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.06,0:15:50.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ah, right. I said something like that yesterday, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.02,0:15:53.10,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Crap! As expected from Nagisa-chan's sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.10,0:15:55.52,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,She's so freaking hot when I see her up close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.23,0:15:58.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This is interesting, so I'll let him keep thinking wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.65,0:16:01.03,Default,San,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.03,0:16:03.32,Default,San,0,0,0,,Would I not be suitable?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:04.78,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,That's not true at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.78,0:16:09.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But wouldn't it be too obvious that you're a fake girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.37,0:16:12.46,Default,San,0,0,0,,It'll be all right. I'll go in a disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.04,0:16:15.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then you're serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:18.13,Default,San,0,0,0,,Yes. I look forward to acting with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.13,0:16:19.55,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.55,0:16:23.09,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.51,0:16:25.34,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,You have a girlfriend?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.89,0:16:28.30,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Someone I've sworn my future to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.30,0:16:30.85,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,She's really beautiful and level-headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.60,0:16:36.65,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm not living aimlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.65,0:16:40.27,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm walking up the stairs to adulthood one step at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:41.78,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Let me see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.07,0:16:44.95,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Introduce me to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.28,0:16:49.53,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,As your younger sister, I want to know what kind of person you're going to marry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.53,0:16:53.33,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okay. Then I'll ask her what her schedule's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.04,0:17:03.88,Default,San,0,0,0,,The Theater Club has many costumes, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.88,0:17:06.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You'll meet Mei-chan the day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.09,0:17:09.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So tomorrow will be a practice run.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.01,0:17:10.81,Default,San,0,0,0,,Okay. I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.85,0:17:14.60,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It feels complicated to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.60,0:17:18.35,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,My mom is my classmate's girlfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.44,0:17:20.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you really sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.82,0:17:23.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sunohara's really hyped over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.99,0:17:27.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He thinks of you as Nagisa's older sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.24,0:17:29.82,Default,San,0,0,0,,Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.32,0:17:31.91,Default,San,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.91,0:17:33.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to flatter you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.83,0:17:39.33,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you reconsider this, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.00,0:17:46.47,Default,San,0,0,0,,Sunohara-san has been on\Nmy mind since the baseball game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.09,0:17:52.47,Default,San,0,0,0,,He looks clumsy and makes many mistakes, but I think he's actually a very kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.06,0:17:57.98,Default,San,0,0,0,,With a push, I think he can start walking a better path.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.48,0:18:02.73,Default,San,0,0,0,,I want to help him get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.73,0:18:09.03,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Okay. If you think so, then I'll help, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.03,0:18:11.91,Default,San,0,0,0,,Yes. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.91,0:18:13.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let me say one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.62,0:18:15.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We need to keep this a secret from the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.91,0:18:17.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.00,0:18:18.62,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.92,0:18:22.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sanae-san might be doing it for the sake of helping others,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.42,0:18:27.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,but knowing him, he might fly into\Na jealous rage and turn Sunohara into mincemeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.38,0:18:33.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,For Sunohara's safety, we need to keep this a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.98,0:18:42.56,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sunohara-san's really nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.56,0:18:44.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Watching him is pissing me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.23,0:18:46.94,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.82,0:18:52.95,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're in love with Mom, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.95,0:18:55.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You idiot! What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:18:57.83,Default,San,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.83,0:18:58.91,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.21,0:19:05.42,Default,San,0,0,0,,It would be strange to call you "Sunohara-kun" when we're dating, so I'll call you "Youhei-kun".
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.42,0:19:07.80,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Y-Y-Y-Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.92,0:19:10.17,Default,San,0,0,0,,Youhei-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.05,0:19:12.93,Default,San,0,0,0,,I look forward to spending time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.72,0:19:18.43,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Crap! She called me "Youhei-kun"!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.23,0:19:22.81,Default,San,0,0,0,,Shall we begin with walking next to each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.81,0:19:23.86,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Y-Y-Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.94,0:19:32.24,Default,San,0,0,0,,You can come closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.66,0:19:34.45,Default,San,0,0,0,,Since we're dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.95,0:19:40.58,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Crap! I smelled something sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.29,0:19:44.50,Default,San,0,0,0,,How about we hold hands, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:48.80,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Crap! They're so soft!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.80,0:19:50.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't come reporting to me each time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.89,0:19:57.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Is that really making him go down the right path?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.14,0:20:00.06,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It feels complicated to me, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.27,0:20:07.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And so the day comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.11,0:20:11.36,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sunohara-san's here already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.36,0:20:13.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Mei-chan, call out to him from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.36,0:20:16.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I bet he'll think it's his girl and be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.04,0:20:21.50,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Then I'll give it a little try.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.96,0:20:26.29,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Did you wait long?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.25,0:20:30.05,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,No, I just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.05,0:20:30.55,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,MEI?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.67,0:20:34.38,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sunohara-san, what are all of these cans?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.55,0:20:36.80,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,This is part of my strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.14,0:20:39.35,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,She'll see this when she gets here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.76,0:20:40.64,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.22,0:20:42.68,Default,San,0,0,0,,Sunohara-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.39,0:20:46.65,Default,San,0,0,0,,You waited for me this long?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.65,0:20:51.03,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You see how it goes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.03,0:20:53.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're really underhanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.65,0:20:57.03,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,This is the game in the name of love guys play.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.57,0:21:01.08,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,In other words, it's a boy love game.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.08,0:21:02.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So you know, that implies something different.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.25,0:21:06.12,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Crap. I drank too much and nature calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.51,0:21:15.84,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,If it's this messy, it'll be a bother, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.84,0:21:17.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.22,0:21:18.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let's clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.55,0:21:19.30,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.47,0:21:25.60,Default,San,0,0,0,,Let me help, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.02,0:21:27.31,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.31,0:21:27.81,Default,San,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.78,0:21:38.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This is rather...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.61,0:21:41.58,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun, are you blushing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.41,0:21:45.96,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,That felt good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.79,0:21:47.71,Default,San,0,0,0,,Youhei-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.38,0:21:52.67,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! Did I make you wait?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.67,0:21:55.97,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.09,0:21:55.97,Default-alt,San,0,0,0,,Not at all. I just arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.76,0:22:05.18,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,This person is my brother's girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.81,0:22:09.77,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(1459.999969,840)\bord0.75\3c&H000000&\blur0.5}To be continued
