Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.28,0:23:43.28,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Enjoy your time with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.70,0:23:45.45,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hold on, Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.45,0:23:50.08,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, but I shouldn't go in case Sanae-san calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.08,0:23:52.37,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,But love is a person's choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.63,0:23:55.75,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.68,0:24:09.64,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,405)\bord0.75\blur0.5\3c&H00000A&}Episode 3
